---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import Breadcrumbs from '../components/layout/Breadcrumbs.astro';
import SchemaBreadcrumb from '../components/seo/SchemaBreadcrumb.astro';

const breadcrumbItems = [{ label: 'About us' }];
---

<BaseLayout
  title="About Arcania — Free Matriz del Destino Calculator"
  description="Meet Arcania: who we are, why we built this Matriz del Destino calculator, and the commitment behind every interpretation."
>
  <SchemaBreadcrumb slot="schema" items={breadcrumbItems} />

  <Breadcrumbs items={breadcrumbItems} />

  <article class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-4 pb-16 sm:px-6">
    <h1 class="font-heading text-4xl font-bold text-ink sm:text-5xl">About Arcania</h1>

    <div class="mt-6 flex flex-col gap-4 text-ink-muted">
      <p>
        Arcania is a free Matriz del Destino calculator built for anyone who wants to understand the
        system created by Natalia Ladini. Our goal is to make the complete reading — octagram, karmic
        tail, love line, money line, and life purpose — accessible to everyone in English, with no
        registration and no payment required. All calculations run in your browser. We never store your
        data.
      </p>

      <h2 class="font-heading text-2xl font-bold text-ink">Our mission</h2>
      <p>
        To make the Matriz del Destino method accessible to everyone, free, clearly, and without
        barriers. No registration, no payments, no gimmicks.
      </p>
      <p>
        The complete calculation — the octagram, the lines, the purposes, the karmic tail — is available
        instantly to anyone with a date of birth.
      </p>

      <h2 class="font-heading text-2xl font-bold text-ink">How we work</h2>
      <p>
        Arcania is a technical project built with rigour. The calculator replicates the standard model
        of points and purposes of the Matriz del Destino, verified against multiple sources and backed
        by automated tests that guarantee your result is correct.
      </p>
      <p>
        The content — the interpretations of the 22 arcana, the guides, and the articles — is written by
        consulting specialised sources on numerology, the major arcana of the tarot, and Natalia Ladini's
        original method. We review every page to keep the language clear, honest, and useful.
      </p>

      <h2 class="font-heading text-2xl font-bold text-ink">What we're not</h2>
      <p>
        We're not psychics, spiritual consultants, or providers of paid personalised readings. Arcania is
        a self-knowledge tool — a symbolic mirror built from your date of birth. What you do with that
        information is entirely up to you.
      </p>
      <p>
        If you're looking for a personalised reading with an expert, we recommend finding a professional
        with real experience and verifiable references.
      </p>

      <h2 class="font-heading text-2xl font-bold text-ink">The project</h2>
      <p>
        Arcania is under constant development. We keep expanding the content, improving the calculator,
        and listening to the people who use it. If you have suggestions, questions, or find something
        that isn't working as it should, you can reach us through our
        <a href="/contacto/" class="font-medium text-primary hover:underline">contact page</a>.
      </p>
      <p>Thank you for using Arcania.</p>
    </div>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>
